language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

capability DeterministicTargetSimulation.
functionality ResetSimulatedTruth.
functionality AdvanceSimulatedPhysics.
functionality EmitSimulatedWire.
functionality HandleSimulatorControl.
functionality ServeSimulatedTarget.

P1000Simulator cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/services/p1000-simulator/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
P1000Simulator provides DeterministicTargetSimulation.
P1000Simulator owns ResetSimulatedTruth.
ResetSimulatedTruth realizes DeterministicTargetSimulation.
ResetSimulatedTruth specifies "Seeded scenario resets hidden physical stem/head/saw state and explicit simulator identity; truth is never normal Target payload.".
P1000Simulator owns AdvanceSimulatedPhysics.
AdvanceSimulatedPhysics realizes DeterministicTargetSimulation.
AdvanceSimulatedPhysics specifies "Advance deterministic configured truth and sensor-facing state; keep simulated truth and emitted P1000 evidence distinct.".
P1000Simulator owns EmitSimulatedWire.
EmitSimulatedWire realizes DeterministicTargetSimulation.
EmitSimulatedWire specifies "Literal/capture-backed P1000 records for mapped actions; unknown physical semantics stay unknown.".
P1000Simulator owns HandleSimulatorControl.
HandleSimulatorControl realizes DeterministicTargetSimulation.
HandleSimulatorControl specifies "Separate simulator-control API, authoritative same-ID command/result lifecycle and recovery; no Machine semantic injection shortcut.".
P1000Simulator owns ServeSimulatedTarget.
ServeSimulatedTarget realizes DeterministicTargetSimulation.
ServeSimulatedTarget specifies "Implement Target framing/session/recovery contract with simulated-wire provenance; do not absorb MachineService ACK policy.".
